  "description": "Dinosaur Survival Simulator - Prehistoric RPG places you in the heart of an ancient world ruled by colossal beasts and the struggle to survive. Live the life of legendary dinosaurs—from swift predators to towering giants—on a journey of transformation, danger, and adaptation. Explore hostile habitats, face unpredictable challenges, and grow stronger to endure the unforgiving prehistoric era.\n\nKey Features:\n-Captivating evolutionary progression: Experience the life paths of multiple dinosaur species, each with unique behaviors and survival traits.\n-Diverse and dangerous environments: Traverse contrasting regions—forests, dry plains, waterfalls, and volcanic zones—each with its own natural challenges.\n-Growth and customization: Upgrade your dinosaur’s essential abilities and adapt to overcome the brutal wilderness.\n-Varied challenges: Complete missions focused on hunting, survival, and territorial dominance, constantly testing your instincts.\n\nStep into a world where nature makes the rules and only the adapted endure.\nProve you have what it takes to become the most feared dinosaur of the prehistoric age.",
